<p style="text-align:center">`$valuelist`</p>
<p>Select <strong>all</strong> of the statements below that are true for this data set.</p>
<p>$answerbox</p>

// === ANSWER ===
$solutionguide = 'Step 1 — Order the data and find the summary statistics. The values in order are ' . $valuelist . '. The mean is ' . round($mean, 3) . ', the median is ' . $med . ', the range is ' . $rng . ' (from ' . $minv . ' to ' . $maxv . '), and the mode is ' . ($hasmode ? ($uniquemode ? $modeval : 'not unique') : 'none, since every value appears once') . '.';
$solutionguide .= ' Step 2 — Check each statement against those values. A statement is true only if it holds for this exact data set; several of the statements are false, and a false statement must be left unchecked.';
