<p>The manager plans to advertise: &ldquo;Our calls are handled in about $mu minutes.&rdquo; Both reps support that sentence equally well.</p>

<p>Explain why a mean of $mu minutes is misleading on its own here, and say which rep&rsquo;s data you would rather use to back up a promise that a caller gets a similar experience every time. Refer to the numbers in your explanation.</p>

