$solutionguide .= '<p>Part d — the rule promises only the smallest possible share. The true percent inside 2 standard deviations can be larger than 75%, so the claim that the rule reports an exact share is rejected.</p>';
$solutionguide .= '<p>Answer: 75%, 88.9% and 95.1%; the rule gives a lower bound, not an exact share.</p>';

// === NAME - DESCRIPTION: Probability That a Sum Is Greater Than a Value - Given a normal population and a random sample of n, find the probability that the sample total exceeds a cutoff, and the standard deviation of the total. ===
// === SET QUESTION TYPE TO: multipart ===

// === COMMON CONTROL ===
loadlibrary("stats");

$mu = randfrom(array(40,45,50,55,60,65));
